HII and president of its Mission Technologies division, said this milestone reflects HII\'s track record for delivering mission-ready autonomous capabilities. The ROMULUS USV is designed to meet the Navy\'s requirements, delivering high-endurance autonomy for intelligence, surveillance, and reconnaissance, as well as counter-unmanned air systems and mine countermeasures.\n\n',)
