st developments. Steven Cook, CFR\'s Eni Enrico Mattei senior fellow for Middle East and Africa studies, provided an update on the war\'s trajectory. Regional dynamics are shaping the conflict, with implications for US foreign policy. Amy Myers Jaffe discussed the energy market implications of the war, both globally and in the US.\n\nID: 4156482\nCREATED: 2026-06-03\nSLUG: in-person-ny-roundtable-irans-government-arab-neighbors-and-the-future-of-the-middle-east\nTEXT: Iran\'s government, Arab neighbors, and the future of the Middle East were discussed at a roundtable in New York. The CFR\'s Young Professionals Briefing Series featured experts exploring the region\'s dynamics and potential future conflicts. Not News Article\n\n\n',)
