trade, challenging traditional futures markets. The transaction utilized the regulatory framework of National Futures Association (NFA) registration, Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC) market oversight, and execution through designated contract markets (DCMs) like Kalshi. This demonstrates the ability to facilitate institutional block orders through traditional wholesale commodities markets. Max Crowley, Kalshi\'s Vice President of Business Development, views this as a step forward in providing institutional functionality and support for such transactions.\n\nID: 4156098\nCREATED: 2026-06-03\nDOMAIN: coindesk.com\nSLUG: galaxy-enters-institutional-prediction-markets-with-usd10-million-arca-trade\nTEXT: Galaxy Digital has launched institutional prediction markets with a $10 million Arca trade, marking the first major digital asset firm to offer large-scale access to event-driven markets. The new service, offered through its global markets trading desk, allows hedge funds and institutional investors to trade contracts tied to political, economic, and geopolitical events. The launch aims to deepen liquidity, attract professional investors, and further institutionalize prediction markets despite regulatory uncertainty.\n\nID: 4156571\nCREATED: 2026-06-03\nDOMAIN: bitcoin.com\nSLUG: gate-partners-with-alpaca-for-upcoming-real-stock-trading-access-for-global-users\nTEXT: Gate Partners With Alpaca for Upcoming Real Stock Trading Access for Global Users. Gate has partnered with Alpaca to provide real stock trading access for global users, marking a significant step towards expanding its services. The partnership aims to offer users a seamless and secure experience, allowing them to trade stocks in real-time. This move is expected to enhance Gate\'s offerings and cater to the growing demand for digital asset trading services.\n\nID: 4156572\nCREATED: 2026-06-03\nDOMAIN: bitcoin.com\nSLUG: zoomex-prediction-market-officially-launches-participate-in-global-trending-events-with-crypto\nTEXT: Zoomex\'s prediction market officially launches, allowing users to participate in global trending events with crypto. The platform enables users to create and manage predictions on various assets, including stocks, cryptocurrencies, and other financial instruments. With the launch, Zoomex aims to tap into the growing demand for decentralized prediction markets, which have gained popularity in recent years.\n\n\n',)
