m. The expert notes that Ethereum recently made a key monthly close below its multi-year upward trend for the second time in 5 months, increasing the likelihood of ETH mirroring its price action from early 2026. This trend involves a monthly close below the trend line of its multi-year uptrend, which has led to limited upside moves and a steady downward trend. Michael Van De Poppe, MNFund\'s CIO, believes ETH is in an ideal entry point after a period of sideways price action. However, the upcoming CLARITY Act vote may provide an "Sell the rumor, Buy the News" scenario, prompting Van De Poppe to add more ETH to his portfolio. Large investors are also accumulating more Ethereum, with wallet addresses holding at least 100,000 ETH steadily adding to their holdings despite ongoing FUD.\n\nID: 4155856\nCREATED: 2026-06-03\nDOMAIN: bitcoinist.com\nSLUG: massive-52m-ethereum-bet-comes-as-tom-lee-says-eth-isnt-reflecting-its-potential\nTEXT: Bitmine has made a massive $52 million bet on Ethereum, purchasing over 5.4 million Ether tokens that are valued at more than $10.5 billion. This stockpile puts the company 90% of the way towards its goal of controlling 5% of Ethereum\'s circulating supply. The purchase comes as ETH has been stuck near $2,000 and failed to match the scale of buying seen in the market.\n\n\n',)
