asting peace in Gaza and the West Bank was also emphasized as important.\n\nID: 4155888\nCREATED: 2026-06-03\nDOMAIN: hurriyetdailynews.com\nSLUG: fidan-to-discuss-drones-nuclear-energy-cooperation-with-s-korea-222849\nTEXT: Fidan to discuss drones, nuclear energy cooperation with S Korea. Fidan is expected to underscore the potential for joint production of drones, following successful past cooperation on the production of Altay tanks. The defense industry will be on the agenda, driven by this achievement. Fidan and Hyun will exchange views on global and regional developments, including the recent conflict between the US and Iran. Fidan also hopes to see South Korea participate in the upcoming NATO summit in Ankara this July, alongside Japan, Australia and New Zealand.\n\nID: 4155823\nCREATED: 2026-06-03\nDOMAIN: hurriyetdailynews.com\nSLUG: turkish-foreign-minister-arrives-in-indonesia-for-talks-222825\nTEXT: Turkish Foreign Minister Fidan arrives in Indonesia for talks, aiming to increase trade volume to $10 billion through cooperation in infrastructure, energy, and technology. The two countries will discuss defense industry cooperation, including a mechanism established by foreign ministers and defense ministers. Fidan will also exchange views on the Gazza developments, Israel-Palestine peace, and the Strait of Hormuz. The Turkish Embassy in Jakarta was established in 1957, and diplomatic relations were first recognized by Türkiye in 1950.\n\nID: 4155610\nCREATED: 2026-06-03\nDOMAIN: tempo.co\nSLUG: prabowo-turkish-fm-meet-in-hambalang-over-mideast\nTEXT: President Prabowo considers Turkey\'s support in the humanitarian mission as a reflection of the deep-rooted friendship between Indonesia and Turkey, with both nations agreeing to tighten coordination in promoting efforts to de-escalate various conflicts in the Middle East. The two nations reaffirmed their joint commitment to advocate for justice and sovereignty for the Palestinian people, with Prabowo and Turkish Foreign Minister Fidan exchanging views on the volatile situation unfolding across the Middle East, particularly in Iran and Palestine.\n\n\n',)
